@baseUrl = http://localhost:5039
@api = {{baseUrl}}/examples/windfarm/api
@conversation = windfarm-http-demo
@scenario = inspection

### Development-only module OpenAPI
GET {{api}}/openapi/windfarm.json

### List repeatable synthetic scenarios
GET {{api}}/scenarios

### Read telemetry with source identity and timestamp
GET {{api}}/scenarios/{{scenario}}/telemetry

### Read maintenance history
GET {{api}}/scenarios/{{scenario}}/history

### Read forecast windows
GET {{api}}/scenarios/{{scenario}}/weather

### Read qualified crews and parts
GET {{api}}/scenarios/{{scenario}}/resources

### Read illustrative planning constraints
GET {{api}}/scenarios/{{scenario}}/procedure

### Create a case (201 + Location); archive before reusing this conversation
# @name createdCase
POST {{api}}/cases
Content-Type: application/json

{ "conversationId": "{{conversation}}", "scenarioId": "{{scenario}}" }

### Read the active case, or 204 when none exists
GET {{api}}/cases/active?conversationId={{conversation}}

### Read the exact case and bounded audit
# @name caseSnapshot
GET {{api}}/cases/{{createdCase.response.body.$.id}}?conversationId={{conversation}}

### Evaluate eligible and blocked alternatives
GET {{api}}/cases/{{createdCase.response.body.$.id}}/options?conversationId={{conversation}}

### Draft a known inspection option; source IDs belong to the inspection fixture
POST {{api}}/cases/{{createdCase.response.body.$.id}}/drafts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "{{conversation}}",
  "optionId": "later:crew-alpha",
  "rationale": "Inspect the observed trend in the later eligible window; cause remains unconfirmed.",
  "sourceIds": ["inspection:telemetry:v1", "inspection:history:v1", "inspection:procedure:v1", "inspection:weather-later:v1", "inspection:crew-alpha:v1", "inspection:parts:v1"]
}

### Submission fails with 409 until actual specialist reviews exist
POST {{api}}/cases/{{createdCase.response.body.$.id}}/proposals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "conversationId": "{{conversation}}" }

### Optional LIVE MODEL CALL: obtain three real A2A reviews and submit, never approve
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Review the existing draft with all three windfarm specialists and submit the proposal if supported. Do not approve it.",
  "agent": "WindfarmCoordinator",
  "vendor": "windfarm",
  "conversationId": "{{conversation}}"
}

### Explicit human approval: first rerun caseSnapshot to read the current frozen revision/hash
POST {{api}}/cases/{{createdCase.response.body.$.id}}/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "{{conversation}}",
  "revision": {{caseSnapshot.response.body.$.revision}},
  "proposalHash": "{{caseSnapshot.response.body.$.proposalHash}}",
  "decision": "approve",
  "idempotencyKey": "human-reviewed-proposal-1",
  "reason": "Reviewed the synthetic plan. No physical work is authorized."
}

### Wrong hash/premature approval must return 409, never create an order
POST {{api}}/cases/{{createdCase.response.body.$.id}}/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "conversationId": "{{conversation}}", "revision": 0, "proposalHash": "invalid", "decision": "approve", "idempotencyKey": "invalid-attempt" }

### Archive and invalidate outstanding decisions
POST {{api}}/cases/{{createdCase.response.body.$.id}}/archive
Content-Type: application/json

{ "conversationId": "{{conversation}}" }

### Unknown fixture returns Problem Details, not fabricated evidence
GET {{api}}/scenarios/unknown/telemetry